00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:44.810
We cannot use words, only
motions and animal sounds,

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.090
which should be funny.

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:49.270
If we can correctly guess
eight animals in two rounds,

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:50.810
the audience wins a fabulous prize.

00:00:50.810 --> 00:00:52.656
We're trying not to let
you down just so you know.

00:00:52.656 --> 00:00:53.489
- For you.

00:00:53.489 --> 00:00:54.322
We're doing this

00:00:54.322 --> 00:00:55.155
