00:01:02.163 --> 00:01:03.120
- Okay, cool.
- Okay.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:04.190
Yeah, you're fidgeting.

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:06.596
It's too bad you don't have
any paper twiddle it down.

